{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-fairway-villas","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"fairway-villas-3","about":"Discover the epitome of modern elegance and natural beauty at Fairway Villas 3, part of the prestigious Emaar South development. Our 4 and 5 -bedroom homes are perfectly situated in a dynamic community, where the charm of contemporary living meets the serenity of nature's embrace. Fairway Villas 3 at Emaar South invites you to experience a lifestyle where the joy of vibrant green golf courses, serene linear parks, and leisure paths merge with a variety of recreational amenities designed to enhance and harmonize your family's life.Fairway Villas 3 stands as a testament to modern architectural design, blending seamlessly with the natural surroundings. Offered in two serene façade colours, Fairway villas 3 boasts  earthy interior tones that evoke a sense of warmth and welcome. Each home is crowned with a spacious roof terrace, offering a tranquil retreat to savor the breathtaking views. This blend of contemporary style and natural elegance ensures a living experience that is both tranquil and stylish.Wake up to unparalleled views at Fairway Villas 3, where each day begins with the picturesque scenery of an 18-hole championship golf course. The pristine fairways and stunning greens form a captivating panorama that is yours to enjoy every day. Positioned amidst the splendor of nature, yet seamlessly connected to a plethora of first-rate amenities, Fairway Villas 3 for sale and for rent in Emaar South epitomizes a lively, family-centric community. It offers an unparalleled blend of modern luxuries and the beauty of the outdoors, making it a perfect setting for those seeking a balanced and enriched lifestyle. Whether you're interested in purchasing or renting, Fairway Villas 3 is a premier choice within Emaar South Fairway Villas.","price":4900000,"title":"Fairway villas 3